/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on map values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - len     — number of key/value pairs in the map
 *   - remove  — method-like field returning a delegate for key removal
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a MapType.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::map
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/map.yr
 * @Author(s):
